ap;text-align:center;word-spacing:0.26em;font-family:&quot;Cormorant Garamond&quot;, &quot;Cormorant Garamond Placeholder&quot;, serif;font-size:36px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.18em;letter-spacing:-0.5px"><div style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;pointer-events:none;opacity:1;color:rgba(43, 45, 45, 0.18);white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center">Together with our families,<br>we would be honoured to have you<br>beside us as we begin our forever.</div><div style="position:relative"><span style="display:inline;opacity:0">Together</span><span> </span><span style="display:inline;opacity:0">with</span><span> </span><span style="display:inline;opacity:0">our</span><span> </span><span style="display:inline;opacity:0">families,</span><br><span style="display:inline;opacity:0">we</span><span> </span><span style="display:inline;opacity:0">would</span><span> </span><span style="display:inline;opacity:0">be</span><span> </span><span style="display:inline;opacity:0">honoured</span><span> </span><span style="display:inline;opacity:0">to</span><span> </span><span style="display:inline;opacity:0">have</span><span> </span><span style="display:inline;opacity:0">you</span><br><span style="display:inline;opacity:0">beside</span><span> </span><span style="display:inline;opacity:0">us</span><span> </span><span style="display:inline;opacity:0">as</span><span> </span><span style="display:inline;opacity:0">we</span><span> </span><span style="display:inline;opacity:0">begin</span><span> </span><span style="display:inline;opacity:0">our</span><span> </span><span style="display:inline;opacity:0">forever.</span></div></div></div></section></div><!--/$--></div><div class="framer-zm60ve" data-framer-name="Invitation Outro"><div class="framer-1rrhfzm" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-i3aj53" data-styles-preset="y4yJj4yN2" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:center">The ceremony begins at half past fo